              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This data file contains the data used for the regression and moderation analyses on emotional reactivity and the impact of social and socioeconomic stressors within the adolescent sample in the article 'Mood and Emotional Reactivity of Adolescents During the COVID-19 Pandemic: Short-Term Effects and Long-Term Effects and the Impact of Social and Socioeconomic Stressors'. <div><br></div>\n\n<p></p>\n<div>Files are accessible to the authors of the study. Interested parties can request access by e-mailing green@essb.eur.nl or crone@essb.eur.nl. When requesting the data, please explain why you would like to access the files.<br><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
                }
              }
            ]
